    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text4]"] = "Did you find Chou`s children? No?! Come on, Chou is my grandma`s best friend, so he must know something useful!",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text5]"] = "Have you ever seen Yang Feng? He was the last head of the Yang family. Though he`s dead, he won`t give up his desire to destroy the Star Tower.",
    ["STR_ID_SugarTang[4565][Text6]"] = "~Anyway, there is still something I can`t understand about my family. I heard the Heaven Fan has the answer I want.",
